       600 m of approach (100, 101), 600 m between the sections (103, 104)
       and 600 m downstream (106, 107). At lat 40 one degree of longitude is
       about 85.28 km, so 0.003518 deg = 300 m and 0.003130 deg = 267 m. The
       sections are 600 m apart so the second's upstream window (the edge
